"controller_mappings"
{
	"version"		"3"
	"title"		"I26 - Steam Deck"
	"description"		"Pad as I26 reads it by default: sticks, triggers, face buttons, bumpers, D-pad and Start/View pass through as an Xbox pad. Left trackpad: radial hardpoint select (keys 1-5). Right trackpad: menu pointer, press = click. Back grips: L4 Emergency Brake (Z), R4/L5/R5 Use Special 1/2/3 (6/7/8)."
